  emoji: '🏅',
  chapterText:
      'After the accident that cost him his left leg below the knee, twelve-year-old Aryan spent months '
      'believing that running, the one thing that had always made him feel truly alive, was now permanently '
      'behind him. Doctors focused on his recovery, physiotherapists focused on his mobility, but nobody '
      'seemed to know quite what to say about his dream of one day representing his state in athletics, a '
      'dream he had held since he was seven years old.\n\n'
      'It was his physiotherapist, Dr. Nandini, who first mentioned para-athletics almost casually during a '
